      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lutherbellhendricksv/{size}/2350_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-17T05:10:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I plan on going through all the characters eventually -- it's just taking longer for each one than I realized it would. I sit down and think \"oh, it should only take me fifteen or twenty minutes to write abou Baron Blade\" but then I realize I have to explain about how villains started out vs how they ended up and this and that and hey I remembered this other thing about this power I already wrote about and when did it get dark?</p>",
